@startuml
title 大禹平台：七个业务模块依赖总览（当前空骨架）
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "Catalog\n产品定义" as Catalog
package "Identity\n身份与登录" as Identity
package "AssetIndex\n文件索引" as AssetIndex
package "Discovery\n数据查询" as Discovery
package "Download\n下载授权与审计" as Download
package "Copilot\nAI 辅助查询" as Copilot
package "Operations\n管理员运维编排" as Operations
package "Shared Kernel\n共用基础类型" as Shared

AssetIndex --> Catalog : 只调用 API
Discovery --> Catalog : 只调用 API
Discovery --> AssetIndex : 只调用 API
Download --> AssetIndex : 只调用 API
Copilot --> Catalog : 只调用 API
Copilot --> Discovery : 只调用 API
Operations --> Catalog : 编排
Operations --> AssetIndex : 编排
Operations --> Discovery : 编排
Operations --> Identity : 编排
Operations --> Download : 编排

Catalog --> Shared
Identity --> Shared
AssetIndex --> Shared
Discovery --> Shared
Download --> Shared
Copilot --> Shared
Operations --> Shared

note bottom
箭头表示“依赖/调用”。
业务模块只能调用目标模块的 api 包，不能调用其 application、domain 或 infrastructure。
end note
@enduml
